  "body": "### Summary\nAs a maintainer, I want the legacy oracles of the M2 read-only captures tested against the Swift parsers, so that the new page states (logged-out MP list, cross-category search, logged-in list, locked topic logged in, checked search filter) are covered by differential tests.\n\n### Scope\nPR #474 adds 9 oracles in `Packages/HFRKit/Tests/HFRParsingTests/Fixtures/M2-readonly/` (R121a, R121b, R121c, R121e, R121f: list kinds; R122a-R122d: topic kind). They are outside the LOT-002/LOT-003 maps because the guard tests (`TopicListDifferentialTests`, `TopicPageMetadataOracleTests`, `TopicPageFlagOracleTests`, `MessageBlockOracleTests`) require every map case to be in their case lists. Move the entries into the maps (or extend the guards), add the cases to those lists, and justify any difference from legacy in the lot specs. R121a legacy result: `noAuth`.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] The 9 cases are tested; each new test shown to fail without the change.\n- [ ] `swift test` green.\n\nRefs #121, #122, #274",
